readable-fusion — a from-scratch reimplementation of ZolikaPatch 7.65.

Written by the OpenZDecomp project. The structure and the Event<Args...> shape
follow GTAIV.EFLC.FusionFix by ThirteenAG (GPL-3.0); the INI grammar reproduced
in source/config.ixx is the contract of feather-ini-parser 1.41 by Turbine1991,
which the original mod linked statically.

